    s__GOING_BACK_WRONG(py_str("Give it six weeks before you judge it: the first weeks back are a bad test of a job, because everything is new, tiring and out of your hands. Write down what is actually wrong - the hours, the manager, the work itself, the money - because the fix is different for each one, and 'I hate it' is too big to ask anybody to solve. If the thing making you dread it is the same thing that made you ill last time, ask your GP for a fit note that says what needs to change; that is what an occupational health referral is for."));
