    s__GOING_BACK_DONT_WANT(py_str("Not wanting to go back is worth taking seriously rather than talking yourself out of: name the one thing you are dreading - the hours, a person, the work itself, the childcare - because the fix is different for each. If it is the hours or the person, ask for the change before the first morning: a phased return, different hours, or a move within the team. If it is the work itself, go back anyway and give it six weeks, because it is much easier to look for another job from inside one than from a gap. Tell one person at home how you feel, so the first week is not being carried alone."));
